---
const STUDIO_URL = 'https://studio.tryskilly.app/signup';
---
<section id="builders" data-skilly="builders" class="relative py-24 lg:py-32 px-6 bg-white overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px" style="background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #E5E5E0, transparent);" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="max-w-site mx-auto grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.94fr)_minmax(0,1.06fr)] lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="text-[13px] font-semibold text-amber-600 tracking-[1.5px] uppercase">Skilly for builders</span>
      <h2 data-reveal class="reveal mt-3 text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[48px] font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight text-gray-900">
        Let visitors ask your website what to do next.
      </h2>
      <p data-reveal class="reveal reveal-delay-1 mt-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600 max-w-[620px]">
        Skilly for Web gives your site a voice-and-pointer guide. Customers can ask questions, hear answers from your content, and see the exact product, button, or setting they should use.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5">
          <div class="text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900">Import your site</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Give Studio a URL and docs. It turns your real product copy into the first project skill.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5">
          <div class="text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900">Preview before install</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Test how Skilly speaks, answers, and points before you add the snippet to production.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5">
          <div class="text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900">One skill per surface</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Each website or app gets its own knowledge, allowed domains, widget style, and usage view.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 p-5">
          <div class="text-[15px] font-bold text-gray-900">Install with one script</div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Drop in the CDN snippet, origin-lock the widget, and keep every change managed from Studio.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
        <a
          href={STUDIO_URL}
          data-ph-event="web_builders_studio_clicked"
          data-ph-prop-location="builders_section"
          data-ph-prop-target-funnel="builders"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 active:scale-[0.98] text-gray-950 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg rounded-lg px-7 py-3.5 text-[16px] font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          Create a Studio project
        </a>
        <a
          href="#top"
          data-ph-event="web_builders_mac_clicked"
          data-ph-prop-location="builders_section"
          data-ph-prop-target-funnel="mac"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-gray-300 hover:border-gray-400 bg-white hover:bg-gray-50 active:scale-[0.98] text-gray-800 rounded-lg px-7 py-3.5 text-[16px] font-semibold transition-all whitespace-nowrap"
        >
          I want Skilly for Mac
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal class="reveal reveal-delay-2 relative rounded-[28px] border border-gray-200 bg-[#11100e] p-4 shadow-2xl overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-80" style="background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 10%, rgba(245,158,11,0.28), transparent 34%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08), transparent 40%);" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="relative rounded-[20px] bg-[#FAFAF8] overflow-hidden border border-white/20">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-200 px-5 py-4">
          <div class="font-bold text-gray-900">Customer website preview</div>
          <div class="hidden sm:flex gap-5 text-[13px] text-gray-500">
            <span>Product</span>
            <span>Pricing</span>
            <span>Support</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid gap-6 p-5 sm:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_250px]">
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 p-6 min-h-[300px]">
            <p class="text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[1.2px] uppercase text-amber-600">Product page</p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">Welcome</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-600">Customers can ask what to do next, compare options, or find the setup path that matches their goal.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 flex gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-lg bg-gray-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Get started</span>
              <span class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700">Contact us</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-7 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Getting started</div>
              <div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Common questions</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-white border border-gray-200 p-5 min-h-[300px]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-gray-950 font-bold">S</div>
              <div>
                <div class="font-bold text-gray-900">Skilly</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500">ready on this page</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 p-4 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
              Ask me where to start, which option fits, or what to click next.
            </div>
            <div class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-gray-700">What can I do here?</div>
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-gray-700">Which plan should I pick?</div>
              <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 px-3 py-2 text-gray-700">Show me the next step</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-full bg-amber-500 text-gray-950 shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/30 font-bold">
          S
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
